Gizmo will concede.

00:18:44.860 --> 00:18:55.480
He's the right choice for a Gremlins 2 video game where it's a top-down action platformer and you have to fight other Gremlins.

00:18:55.680 --> 00:19:29.220
Sure. You're in the lobby, then you're in the labs, eventually making your way to the TV studio.

00:19:29.560 --> 00:19:41.520
The weird thing is that obviously being in a laboratory doesn't really open itself to any exciting gameplay for Gizmo.

00:19:41.520 --> 00:19:50.920
So the environmental hazards and obstacles that they kind of like put in your way don't really like they don't really work with the environment.

