00:28:42.740 --> 00:28:43.700
The music is fantastic.

00:28:43.900 --> 00:28:54.100
And I know I said Sunsoft is known for having great tracks, but I did, this was one of those games where, like, I did want to keep getting by to see the new stage music.

00:28:54.380 --> 00:28:55.460
Oh, I completely agree.

00:28:55.620 --> 00:28:58.860
